{"path":"container/span/rbegin","title":"std::span<T,Extent>::rbegin, std::span<T,Extent>::crbegin","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::span&lt;T,Extent&gt;::</span>rbegin, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::span&lt;T,Extent&gt;::</span>crbegin","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/span/rbegin","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed span. It corresponds to the last element of the non-reversed span.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> reverse_iterator rbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> const_reverse_iterator crbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reverse iterator to the first element of the reversed <code>span</code>. It corresponds to the last element of the non-reversed <code>span</code>. If the <code>span</code> is empty, the returned iterator is equal to <span class=\"t-lc\">rend()</span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-image\">\n<p><img alt=\"range-rbegin-rend.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/3/39/range-rbegin-rend.svg\" width=\"589\" height=\"250\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reverse iterator to the first element.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator/base\">underlying iterator</a> of the returned reverse iterator is the <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/end\">end iterator</a>. Hence the returned iterator is invalidated if and when the end iterator is invalidated.</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;span&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> code<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"@droNE_T0P_w$s@s#_SECRET_a,p^42!\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> hack <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> O<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> O <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu8\">0141</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">120</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy\"><span class=\"kw1595\">std::<span class=\"me2\">copy_if</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>code.<span class=\"me1\">rbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, code.<span class=\"me1\">rend</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ostream_iterator\"><span class=\"kw675\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, hack<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>password</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span/rend\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rend</span><span>crend</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a reverse iterator to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/rbegin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rbegin</span><span>crbegin</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(C++14)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a reverse iterator to the beginning of a container or array <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text